<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>{{ subject }}</title>
</head>
<body>
    <p>Hello,</p>
    <p>{{ subject }}:</p>
    <ul>
        {% for line in lines %}
            <li>{{ line.name }} ({{ line.prefix }}) works until {{ line.worksUntil }}</li>
        {% endfor %}
    </ul>
    <p>To keep Claude Code or the browser plugin working, make a new token and put it in their settings:</p>
    <p><a href="{{ tokensLink }}">Your API tokens</a></p>
    <p>You get this email once per token, before it stops working.</p>
</body>
</html>
